Third-party component shipped inside the installer
--------------------------------------------------
bin/wmp.dll is a rebuilt Windows Media Player control from Wine 9.0
(dlls/wmp) with the patch in patches/wine-9.0-wmp-pause.patch applied.
Wine is Copyright (c) the Wine project authors and is licensed under the
GNU Lesser General Public License version 2.1 or later. That license, not
the terms above, applies to wmp.dll. Source: https://dl.winehq.org/wine/source/9.0/
plus the patch in patches/. Build steps: patches/README.md.
